          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa omundu omuruchi aba niyoonoona, nakhola elala khu ako aka OMWAMI Nyasayewe yakaana mbu karakholwa ta, khulwa okhukorwa, ne nali neshiuku toto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naba namanyibwa eshionoonoshie eshia yoonoona, yeetse neshihaanwashie, mbu imbusi ikhole eyibula obulema; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nara omukhono khumurwe kweimbusi, nachiirila habundu aha beerelanga omusango kwokhusambwa imbeli w; nomusango kwobwonooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukuhani abukule khumalasile komusango kwobwonooni nende olwala, nakara khunzika tsieshimalilo shiemisango emisambe, natsukha amalasile kandi kosi hasi weshimalilo shiemisango emisambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amasinya kakwo kosi akasambile khushimalilo, shinga amasinya komusango kwokhwishia; ne omukuhani amutise khukeshionoonoshie, naye alaieshelwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
