          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu yesi owokhubandu beshialo naba niyoonoona khulwa okhukorwa, nakhola elala khu ako aka OMWAMI yakaana mbu karakholwa ta, ne nali neshiuku toto, ",
