              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amasinya kakwo kosi akayinie, shinga amasinya kelikondi olwa kayinibungwa khumusango kwokhwishia; mana omukuhani akasambile khushimalilo, khubihaanwa biOMWAMI ebikholelwa omulilo; ne omukuhani amutise khukeshionoonoshie eshia yoonoonile, naye alaleshelwa.",
